s 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, July to August came in at 64% and November to December at 59% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 56% and March to April at 54% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
